  "translation": "Olsem na, lukluk, ol dei i kamap — Yahwe i tok — na bai ol i no tokim moa Topet na Gole bilong pikinini bilong Hinom, tasol Gole bilong Kilim Ol Man; na bai ol i berim long Topet, bilong wanem i no gat ples.",
